{"id":"f3921429aff327c8","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-effective-procedure.md","title":"Effective Procedures Relative to Representations","display":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedures Relative to Representations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-effective-procedure","aliases":["57-df-effective-procedure"],"display":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedures Relative to Representations","depends_on":["[[57-df-partial-function]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-effective-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-effective-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedures Relative to Representations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为固定单射表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\rightharpoonup Y\">\\(f:X\\rightharpoonup Y\\)</span>。部分函数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>。无下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}\\)</span> 相对当前固定表示环境定义，不表示未形式化的经验概念。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a> 的三元部分函数图谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;[\\\\\n&amp;(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),v))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),\\iota_Y(y)))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;[\\\\\n&amp;(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),v))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),\\iota_Y(y)))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义要求有定义输入恰好停机，且停机结果为对应的有效输出表示；不能用非法输出代替应有的发散行为。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y$ 为集合，$\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$、$\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$ 为固定单射表示；$f:X\\rightharpoonup Y$。部分函数取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。无下标 $\\mathrm{Effective}$ 相对当前固定表示环境定义，不表示未形式化的经验概念。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y$ 为集合，$\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$、$\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$ 为固定单射表示；$f:X\\rightharpoonup Y$。部分函数取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。无下标 $\\mathrm{Effective}$ 相对当前固定表示环境定义，不表示未形式化的经验概念。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)$ 使用 [[57-df-partial-function]] 的三元部分函数图谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\rightharpoonup Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Partial}(f,X,Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;[\\\\\n&(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),v))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,\\iota_X(x),\\iota_Y(y)))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1509,"backlinks":[{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_k$；$D_k$、数值元组及打包映射取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。输入和输出使用 [[57-df-encoding]] 的同一 $\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}$ 取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]] 的机器谓词，底层机器取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本环境固定 $X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}$。正规形对应取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["cda5e2779ea7246f","20d4e2ccede99498"]}